<title>UK: POLL-Extel survey - UK and global equity strategy.</title>
<headline>POLL-Extel survey - UK and global equity strategy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are results of the 1997 Extel survey of investment analysts, weighted by size of funds under management by respondents who voted for them.</p>
<p> UK equity market strategy     Global market strategy</p>
<p> 1. BZW				1. BZW</p>
<p> 2. HSBC James Capel	     2. SBC Warburg</p>
<p> 3. Merrill Lynch		  3. Morgan Stanley</p>
<p> 4. ABN AMRO Hoare Govett	4. Kleinwort Benson</p>
<p> 5. NatWest Securities	   5. Merrill Lynch</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
